    {
      "text": "ye have forgotten what great things the Lord hath done for us, 1 Ne. 7:11. fruit of tree of life is greatest of all gifts of God, 1 Ne. 15:36. latter-day seer shall be great like Moses, 2 Ne. 3:9. great man humbleth himself not, therefore forgive him not, 2 Ne. 12:9 (Isa. 2:9). Lamoni mistakes Ammon2 for the Great Spirit, Alma 18:2–21 (19:25). Ammon2 teaches Lamoni about the Great Spirit, Alma 18:22–35. when trump shall sound, all shall come forth, both small and great, Morm. 9:13. Shule remembers great things the Lord had done for forefathers in bringing them across great deep, Ether 7:27.",
